    {
      "text": "Herod … slew all the children, Matt. 2:16. whom ye slew between the temple and the altar, Matt. 23:35. Son … be slain, and be raised the third day, Luke 9:22. apostles, and some of them they shall slay, Luke 11:49. Jews persecute Jesus, and sought to slay him, John 5:16. raised up Jesus, whom ye slew, Acts 5:30. Arise, Peter; slay and eat, Acts 11:7. desired they Pilate that he should be slain, Acts 13:28. by the cross, having slain the enmity thereby, Eph. 2:16. They … were slain with the sword, Heb. 11:37. stood a Lamb as it had been slain, Rev. 5:6. I saw … souls of them that were slain, Rev. 6:9. were prepared … to slay the third part of men, Rev. 9:15. Lamb slain from the foundation of the world, Rev. 13:8 (Moses 7:47).",
